## Overview (architecture & docs)

**Scope:** a **production-lite** newsroom — bounded asyncio services, SQLite-first persistence, optional PostgreSQL/Redis for scaling. This is **not** a hosted CI platform or Kubernetes-style control plane; operational tooling is scripts plus thin CLIs (`tools/*`, `utils/*`).

